plus the assignemt where you set up the row of circles reminded me of a thumb
I was gonna try and work arrays into this one but ultimately I didn't really need to? 
I considered putting images or more infinitely looping squares in each of the little rectangles, but ultimately the plain appearance just about
sums up everything you get out of doomscrolling irl